+
+# Terms added with the Nov 2026 update
+
+| Term | Meaning |
+|------|---------|
+| **Lipa Mos Mos / Lipa Mdogo Mdogo** | Tenants pay rent in small instalments; PAY credits the landlord and settles by transfer. |
+| **Instalment revenue** | Surcharge (Lipa Mos Mos) or service fee plus transfer-cost reserve (Lipa Mdogo Mdogo), less the desk share and Paystack fee. |
+| **Transfer margin** | Settlement and reserve money collected, less the real Paystack transfer cost. |
+| **Revenue-only line** | A money line (settlement fee, ledger row, revenue record) that is not a customer checkout: counts in revenue, not in attempts or success rate. |
+| **Convenience fee** | The tier-based percentage of rent the landlord pays the platform for collecting through Paystack. |
+| **Desk agent / rank** | A DESK distribution agent: clerk, senior, lead, admin or internal. |
+| **Desk commission** | The agent's share of a desk-attributed payment, derived from the recorded share percentage. |
+| **House to Rent inquiry** | A tenant's SMS inquiry to a manager about a vacant unit, charged in SMS credits. |
